{
 "_doc": "Tier-3 pool building (random towns, industrial lots): a packing plant the Cordon took over to can rations. Route: the front office is bolted -> round the west side: a truck went through the dock wall -> the dock (jaws among the totes) -> the retort room: two of the night shift in the baskets wake when you come in (ambush) -> the packing floor, two storeys high, the line still on the belts -> up the stair to the gallery (loose boards) -> the foreman's office: the cold-store key (taking it wakes the line below: ambush) -> back down -> the cold store (the Cordon's alarm in one dressing): the quartermaster guards the ration stock -> through the front office, unbolting the street door. See docs/POI_AUTHORING.md.",
